{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 589699, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 120232, "uid": 81618, "type": 4, "title": "RDRB百分比技能FT伤害在线计算器", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1682585139, "updated_at": 1682645770, "updated_uid": 81618, "comment_at": 1689595238, "last_at": 1690684064, "comment_count": 18, "status": 1, "summary": "前言21年10月的时候，我做了一个Excel的伤害计算器，然后经过几期Raid和WB的测试，差不多有三四个月的时间，修复了许多计算公式上的错误，计算出的伤害值也越来越准确。之后又出了彩附魔，我因为偷懒", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 14, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7757, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "江苏省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 9, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 589699, "content": "<div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\">前言</div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 21年10月的时候，我做了一个Excel的伤害计算器，然后经过几期Raid和WB的测试，差不多有三四个月的时间，修复了许多计算公式上的错误，计算出的伤害值也越来越准确。之后又出了彩附魔，我因为偷懒就没有更新。</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 在后来的这一年里，我也就Raid的时候用计算器，看看FT时Buff有没有吃全，能不能优化。手机虽然能用Excel，但多少有点不方便，所以我就想着做一个网页版的计算器。</div></span></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\">开始使用</div></div><br></div><div id=\"calcload_zzk\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<input id=\"load1_zzk\" style=\"display :none;\" value=\"!function(){\nfunction dealnumber(s){\ns=s!=null?s.replace(/[\\s',']/g,''):'0';\nreturn (s.length==0||isNaN(s))?'0':s;\n}\nfunction mp10(n){\nreturn n.indexOf('.')<0?(n+'0'):((n.split('.')[0]==0?'':n.split('.')[0])+(n.split('.')[1].length==0?'0':n.split('.')[1].substring(0,1)));\n}\n\nfunction calcFeverTimeDamage(){\nvar bossdefend=dealnumber(document.getElementById('bossdefend').value);\nvar bossdefup=dealnumber(document.getElementById('bossdefup').value);\nvar bossdefadd=dealnumber(document.getElementById('bossdefadd').value);\nvar bossskdef=dealnumber(document.getElementById('bossskdef').value);\nvar bosscridef=dealnumber(document.getElementById('bosscridef').value);\n\nvar weakpoint=document.getElementById('weakpoint').value;\nvar critical=document.getElementById('critical').value;\nvar whiteattack=dealnumber(document.getElementById('whiteattack').value);\nvar redattack=dealnumber(document.getElementById('redattack').value);\nvar redagility=dealnumber(document.getElementById('redagility').value);\nvar redcritical=dealnumber(document.getElementById('redcritical').value);\nvar skpercent=dealnumber(document.getElementById('skpercent').value);\nvar atkup=dealnumber(document.getElementById('atkup').value);\nvar atksteal=dealnumber(document.getElementById('atksteal').value);\nvar skatkup=dealnumber(document.getElementById('skatkup').value);\nvar skdmgup=dealnumber(document.getElementById('skdmgup').value);\nvar weakdmgup=dealnumber(document.getElementById('weakdmgup').value);\nvar cridmgup=dealnumber(document.getElementById('cridmgup').value);\n\nvar defdown=dealnumber(document.getElementById('defdown').value);\nvar defpierc=dealnumber(document.getElementById('defpierc').value);\n\nvar defigndmg=dealnumber(document.getElementById('defigndmg').value);\nvar skadddmg=dealnumber(document.getElementById('skadddmg').value);\nvar addtype=document.getElementById('addtype').value;\nvar otheradddmg=dealnumber(document.getElementById('otheradddmg').value);\n\nvar bossfinaldefend=(bossdefend*Math.max(0,1000+mp10(bossdefup)*1-mp10(defdown)*1)+bossdefadd*1000)*Math.max(0,1000-mp10(defpierc))/1000000;\ndocument.getElementById('bossfinaldefend').value=(bossfinaldefend+'').indexOf('.')<0?bossfinaldefend:bossfinaldefend.toFixed(1);\nvar dmgpp1=200000-16*Math.min(5000,bossfinaldefend);\nvar dmgpp2=200000+75*bossfinaldefend;\nvar wanzunpp1=12500000-Math.min(5000,bossfinaldefend);\nvar wanzunpp2=125000000-10000*Math.min(5000,bossfinaldefend);\nvar defigndmgpp1=50000-Math.min(20000,bossfinaldefend);\nvar defigndmgpp2=50000;\n\nvar dmgm1=(2000+mp10(skdmgup)*2+mp10(weakdmgup)*2+redagility*1+mp10(cridmgup)*2*critical+redcritical*critical-mp10(bossskdef)*2-mp10(bosscridef)*2*critical)*3;\ndmgm1=dmgm1<0?0:dmgm1;\nvar dmgm2=10000;\nvar dmga1=whiteattack*25*(redattack*1+1250)*(mp10(weakpoint)*1+critical*10);\nvar dmga2=1000000;\nvar dmgb1=(1000+mp10(atkup)*1)*(1000+mp10(atksteal)*1)*mp10(skpercent);\nvar dmgb2=1000000000;\n\nvar dmg=0;\nif(dmgm1==0){\ndmg=(dmga1/dmga2)*(dmgb1/dmgb2)*(dmgpp1/dmgpp2)*(wanzunpp1/wanzunpp2);\n}else if((dmgm1/dmgm2)<(wanzunpp1/wanzunpp2)){\ndmg=(dmga1/dmga2)*(dmgb1/dmgb2)*(dmgpp1/dmgpp2)*(dmgm1*mp10(skatkup)/(dmgm2*1000))+(dmga1/dmga2)*(dmgb1/dmgb2)*(dmgpp1/dmgpp2)*(wanzunpp1/wanzunpp2);\n}else{\ndmg=(dmga1/dmga2)*(dmgb1/dmgb2)*(dmgpp1/dmgpp2)*(dmgm1*(1000+mp10(skatkup)*1)/(dmgm2*1000));\n}\ndmg+=((dmgm1*defigndmgpp1)/(dmgm2*defigndmgpp2))*defigndmg;\ndmg+=(skadddmg*(addtype*1+1)+otheradddmg*1);\n\ndocument.getElementById('ftdmg').value=dmg.toFixed(1);\n}\n\nvar rbbossdef=[0,1408,1431,1418,1414,1415,1416,1422,1420,1410,1419,1416,1419,1424,1435,1432,1429,1431,1427,1438,1444,1433,1436,1439,1435,1441,1440,1445,1440,1440,1445];\nfunction setBossMianban(){\nif(document.getElementById('battletype').value==0){\nsetRagnaBurstDefend();\ndocument.getElementById('bossdefup').value=100;\ndocument.getElementById('bossdefadd').value='';\ndocument.getElementById('bosscridef').value='';\ndocument.getElementById('rblvl').style.display='inline';\n}\nif(document.getElementById('battletype').value==1){\ndocument.getElementById('bossdefend').value=2329;\ndocument.getElementById('bossfinaldefend').value='';\ndocument.getElementById('bossdefup').value=200;\ndocument.getElementById('bossdefadd').value='';\ndocument.getElementById('bossskdef').value='';\ndocument.getElementById('bosscridef').value=80;\ndocument.getElementById('rblvl').style.display='none';\n}\n}\nfunction setRagnaBurstDefend(){\nvar rblvl=document.getElementById('rblvl').value;\ndocument.getElementById('bossdefend').value=rbbossdef[rblvl];\ndocument.getElementById('bossfinaldefend').value='';\nif(rblvl>5) document.getElementById('bossskdef').value=90;\nelse document.getElementById('bossskdef').value='';\n}\nwindow.calcftdmg_zzk=calcFeverTimeDamage;\nwindow.changebattletype_zzk=setBossMianban;\nwindow.changerblvl_zzk=setRagnaBurstDefend;\n}();\">\n<input type=\"button\" onmouseover=\"eval('var script=document.createElement(\\'script\\');script.type=\\'text/javascript\\';script.innerHTML=document.getElementById(\\'load1_zzk\\').value;document.getElementsByTagName(\\'head\\')[0].appendChild(script);document.getElementById(\\'calcload_zzk\\').remove();document.getElementById(\\'calc_main_zzk\\').style.display=\\'block\\';')\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;background-color: violet;width: 150px;height: 25px;\" value=\"-> 启动计算器 <-\">\n<br>\n</div><div id=\"calc_main_zzk\" style=\"display: none;\"><style type=\"text/css\">\n.numberight{width: 50px; text-align: right;border-radius: 5px;}\n.remark_zzk{display: none;position: absolute;background-color: whitesmoke;font-size:12px;width: 200px;border:2px dotted black;border-radius: 5px;word-wrap: break-word;padding: 10px;}\n.tipscircle_zzk{margin-left:5px;border:1px solid black;border-radius: 10px;}\n.tipscircle_zzk:hover + .remark_zzk{display: block;}\n</style>\n场景<select id=\"battletype\">\n<option value=\"1\">Raid Boss Lv30</option>\n<option value=\"0\">Ragna Burst</option>\n</select><select id=\"rblvl\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<option value=\"1\">Lv1</option>\n<option value=\"2\">Lv2</option>\n<option value=\"3\">Lv3</option>\n<option value=\"4\">Lv4</option>\n<option value=\"5\">Lv5</option>\n<option value=\"6\">Lv6</option>\n<option value=\"7\">Lv7</option>\n<option value=\"8\">Lv8</option>\n<option value=\"9\">Lv9</option>\n<option value=\"10\">Lv10</option>\n<option value=\"11\">Lv11</option>\n<option value=\"12\">Lv12</option>\n<option value=\"13\">Lv13</option>\n<option value=\"14\">Lv14</option>\n<option value=\"15\">Lv15</option>\n<option value=\"16\">Lv16</option>\n<option value=\"17\">Lv17</option>\n<option value=\"18\">Lv18</option>\n<option value=\"19\">Lv19</option>\n<option value=\"20\">Lv20</option>\n<option value=\"21\">Lv21</option>\n<option value=\"22\">Lv22</option>\n<option value=\"23\">Lv23</option>\n<option value=\"24\">Lv24</option>\n<option value=\"25\">Lv25</option>\n<option value=\"26\">Lv26</option>\n<option value=\"27\">Lv27</option>\n<option value=\"28\">Lv28</option>\n<option value=\"29\">Lv29</option>\n<option value=\"30\">Lv30</option>\n</select><br>\n<input type=\"button\" onmouseover=\"changebattletype_zzk()\" value=\"切换场景和层级后点此刷新Boss属性\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;\"><br>\nBoss防御力<input id=\"bossdefend\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\" value=\"2329\">，总计：<input id=\"bossfinaldefend\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\" style=\"border: none; background: #ddd;\" readonly=\"\"><br>\nBoss防御力↑<input id=\"bossdefup\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\" value=\"200\">%<br>\nBoss防御力追加<input id=\"bossdefadd\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\"><br>\nBoss技能伤害防御<input id=\"bossskdef\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<br>\nBoss暴击伤害防御<input id=\"bosscridef\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\" value=\"80\">%<br>\n是否弱点<select id=\"weakpoint\">\n<option value=\"1.4\">弱点</option>\n</select><br>\n是否暴击<select id=\"critical\">\n<option value=\"0\">不暴击</option>\n<option value=\"1\">暴击</option>\n</select><br>\n白攻<input id=\"whiteattack\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">\n红攻<input id=\"redattack\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\"><br>\n红敏<input id=\"redagility\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">\n红暴<input id=\"redcritical\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\"><br>\n技能百分比<input id=\"skpercent\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<br>\n总计攻击力↑<input id=\"atkup\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<a class=\"tipscircle_zzk\">注</a><span class=\"remark_zzk\">攻击力↑、双刃剑、狂暴化、应援、蓄气、痛苦升华、图鉴Buff、队长技能等，还有武器二号位的双刃剑彩附魔。</span><br>\n攻击力窃取<input id=\"atksteal\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<a class=\"tipscircle_zzk\">注</a><span class=\"remark_zzk\">技能面板改版后只显示减攻数值，加攻数值是减攻数值的两倍。</span><br>\n总计技能攻击力↑<input id=\"skatkup\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<a class=\"tipscircle_zzk\">注</a><span class=\"remark_zzk\">技能攻击力↑、Normal技能攻击力↑、反击姿态等，如果队长技能、玩偶、玩偶馆里有此类Buff也要加上。</span><br>\n总计技能伤害量↑<input id=\"skdmgup\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<a class=\"tipscircle_zzk\">注</a><span class=\"remark_zzk\">技能伤害量↑、Normal技能伤害量↑等，技能伤害防御↓取绝对值加入。</span><br>\n总计弱点伤害量↑<input id=\"weakdmgup\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<a class=\"tipscircle_zzk\">注</a><span class=\"remark_zzk\">弱点伤害量↑、应援、战场Buff、宝石加成等，弱点伤害防御↓取绝对值加入。</span><br>\n总计暴击伤害量↑<input id=\"cridmgup\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<a class=\"tipscircle_zzk\">注</a><span class=\"remark_zzk\">暴击伤害量↑、觉醒等，暴击伤害防御↓取绝对值加入。</span><br>\n防御力↓<input id=\"defdown\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<br>\n穿透<input id=\"defpierc\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">%<br>\n总计无视防御伤害<input id=\"defigndmg\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\"><br>\n技能追加伤害<input id=\"skadddmg\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\">\n类型<select id=\"addtype\">\n<option value=\"0\" selected=\"\">不翻倍</option>\n<option value=\"1\">翻倍</option>\n</select><a class=\"tipscircle_zzk\">注</a><span class=\"remark_zzk\">如果技能中的追加伤害在点火前后皆由弱点攻击触发，那么这个追加伤害在攻击发生暴击时会翻倍。</span><br>\n其他追加伤害<input id=\"otheradddmg\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\"><br>\n<input type=\"button\" value=\"计算\" onmouseover=\"calcftdmg_zzk()\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 25px; border-radius: 5px;\"><br>\nFT伤害<input id=\"ftdmg\" type=\"text\" class=\"numberight\" style=\"width: 100px;\"><br></div><div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "个性签名", "follow_num": 33, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "锟斤拷烫烫烫", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 97889183, "content_num": 37, "read_num": 250944, "like_num": 332}, "update_user": {"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "个性签名", "follow_num": 33, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "last_ip_area": "江苏省", "last_login_device_num": 2}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/862842.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}], "reward": {"user_count": 0, "last_user_list": null}, "content_tj_eq": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_lineup": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "content_1": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_eq_cdn": "", "content_tj_lineup_cdn": "", "content_live_2d": "", "hot_content_strategies": [{"id": 95082, "name": "Raid大型攻略", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 168545, "name": "（23-7在线更新）天子培养价值及相性", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 166473, "name": "（翻牌本挖矿更新）挖矿攻略及数据分析", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 53131, "name": "raid的图文讲解", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}], "related_strategies": [{"id": 165459, "name": "点火系统", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/15/27427.png", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 90725, "name": "玩偶玩法", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/15/237456.png", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 164838, "name": "温泉攻略", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/92835/2022/7/17/918723.png", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 167061, "name": "装备强化", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/81618/2022/8/9/950860.png", "jump_url": ""}], "entry_pid": 111540}, "meta": {"request_id": "request:2cacba30-5c85-4fd6-a232-5495c3f90abd", "trace_id": "trace:131be810-9673-4c79-bb14-a3d1279e96de"}}